            "title": "全日收市︱成交再縮 恒指跌幅擴至250點收報24,667點 滙控與內地金融股領跌",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美股期指持續向下，港股午後跌勢隨之加劇，主板交投則再縮至不足1,900億元。滙控(00005)與內地金融股均是拖低大市的罪魁，騰訊(00700)等個別科網卻續強勢。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/bplib_20230703-172008__source-web_00005.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/bplib_20230703-172008__source-web_00005.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：滙控官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數高開16點、報24,934點便暫時行人止步，未幾開始轉跌，早市最多僅跌139點，沽壓尚算有限，但午後形勢轉變為拾級向下，後段最低曾報24,657點，跌260點，其後跌幅一直持續在逾200點水平。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指收報24,667點，跌250點或1%。恒生科技指數午後逐漸轉跌，但仍相對跑贏大市，收跌26點或0.62%，報4,291點；國企指數跌79點或0.96%，報8,204點。主板成交 億元。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16770945-%e5%85%a8%e6%97%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82%ef%b8%b1%e6%88%90%e4%ba%a4%e5%86%8d%e7%b8%ae-%e6%81%92%e6%8c%87%e8%b7%8c%e5%b9%85%e6%93%b4%e8%87%b3250%e9%bb%9e%e6%94%b6%e5%a0%b124667%e9%bb%9e-%e6%bb%99%e6%8e%a7",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK-5.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 16:15:52",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "市傳壁仞考慮配股籌約10億美元 正探討投資者興趣",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">《彭博》引述消息人士指，「國產GPU四小龍」之一的壁仞科技(06082)正考慮再向市場配股，正開始探討投資者興趣。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：壁仞科技官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/02/20250224_FI_source-web_Biren-2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：壁仞科技官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/02/20250224_FI_source-web_Biren-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：壁仞科技官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">報道指，今次壁仞的意向集資額約10億美元，較7月份IPO禁售期過後首次配股集資約70.69億元相差不遠。由於該公司在7月配股時承諾於90日內不再售股，故最快也要10月初才可啟動IPO後第2次配股。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">該股原本逆市報升，於下午接近3時突然「插水」，收市前跌幅擴大至逾3%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16770813-%e5%b8%82%e5%82%b3%e5%a3%81%e4%bb%9e%e8%80%83%e6%85%ae%e9%85%8d%e8%82%a1%e7%b1%8c%e7%b4%8410%e5%84%84%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83-%e6%ad%a3%e6%8e%a2%e8%a8%8e%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87%e8%80%85%e8%88%88%e8%b6%a3",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/04/20260422_FI_source-web_06082.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 16:02:33",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "據報賽力斯與華為合作模式將調整 午後股價急回",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內地媒體報道，賽力斯(09927)與華為的智選車模式將在本周進行調整；報道曝光後賽力斯A、H齊急回。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至下午約3時10分，該公司H股跌6.61%，壣34.5元，成交1.24億元；賽力斯A股(601127.SH)收市也跌5.09%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16770519-%e6%93%9a%e5%a0%b1%e8%b3%bd%e5%8a%9b%e6%96%af%e8%88%87%e8%8f%af%e7%82%ba%e5%90%88%e4%bd%9c%e6%a8%a1%e5%bc%8f%e5%b0%87%e8%aa%bf%e6%95%b4-%e5%8d%88%e5%be%8c%e8%82%a1%e5%83%b9%e6%80%a5%e5%9b%9e",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/10/20251014_FI_source-web_601127-2.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 15:12:28",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "午後向下 滬指收跌21點 深指挫0.72% 寧德時代A、H齊軟",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深兩市股指午後雙雙下滑，齊跌穿早市低位，兩市交投再縮至1.61萬億元(人民幣‧下同)。熱門股互有升跌，寧德時代(03750)則A、H齊挫。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"巴士的報記者攝\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/20260806_CR_source-BP_FK_10.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"巴士的報記者攝\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/20260806_CR_source-BP_FK_10.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">巴士的報記者攝</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">上證綜指低開後曾於初段跌至3,870點，挫14點，但在經濟數據公布後反彈，早市中段開始倒升，最高見3,891點，升6點，於早市後段開始回軟並轉跌，午後延續一浪低於一浪走勢，跌幅曾擴大至27點，低見3,858點，尾市略為回順；滬指最後收報3,864點，跌21點或0.54%，成交7,639.83億元 。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深證成指先於早段經歷好淡爭持，早市中段反覆轉升，但在全日高位13,484點時也只升99點，其後拾級向下，午後進入跌市，最低報13,273點，跌111點，收市前10多分鐘跌幅收窄至百點以內；深指收報13,287點，跌96點或0.72%，成交8,487.34億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300指數也跌30點或0.67%，以4,450點收市；創業板指數跌37點或1.15%，報3,247點。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-9.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-9.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">熱門股其實互有升跌，個別A+H成員跌勢較明顯，寧德時代A股(300750.SZ)收挫6.16%，報316.36元，是A+H成員中跌幅最大的A股；該公司H股午後表現也排在藍籌隊末。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">有媒體報道指，賽力斯(09927)與華為的智選車模式將在本周進行調整，賽力斯A股(601127.SH)午後急回，收報45.46元，跌5.09%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16770432-%e5%8d%88%e5%be%8c%e5%90%91%e4%b8%8b-%e6%bb%ac%e6%8c%87%e6%94%b6%e8%b7%8c21%e9%bb%9e-%e6%b7%b1%e6%8c%87%e6%8c%ab0-72-%e5%af%a7%e5%be%b7%e6%99%82%e4%bb%a3a%e3%80%81h%e9%bd%8a%e8%bb%9f",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250407_FI_source-ap_AShare.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 15:07:15",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
