        {
            "title": "日股午後轉弱 轉跌0.01%收市",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日股表現波動，日經平均指數由中段最多升1.4%，到午後重新轉跌收場，收報63,484點，微跌8點或0.01%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16770283-%e6%97%a5%e8%82%a1%e5%8d%88%e5%be%8c%e8%bd%89%e5%bc%b1-%e8%bd%89%e8%b7%8c0-01%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82",
